WEBVTT

00:01:26.659 --> 00:01:31.018
Stvorena je nova masina za proizvodnju tih ljudi:

00:01:31.018 --> 00:01:33.914
skola.

00:01:33.914 --> 00:01:36.691
Skole proizvode ljude

00:01:36.691 --> 00:01:40.540
koji onda postaju dio

00:01:40.540 --> 00:01:43.925
birokratske administrativne masine.

00:01:43.925 --> 00:01:48.315
Ti ljudi moraju biti identicni.

00:01:48.315 --> 00:01:50.472
Moraju znati tri stvari:

00:01:50.472 --> 00:01:53.512
Moraju imati dobar rukopis zato sto se podaci ispisuju rucno;

00:01:53.512 --> 00:01:55.667
moraju znati citati;

00:01:55.667 --> 00:01:57.946
moraju znati mnoziti,

00:01:57.946 --> 00:02:01.609
djeliti, zbrajati i oduzimati u glavi.